{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"みなさまこんばんは！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"北野日奈子です(｡・・｡)♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hinako.kitano/img/files/46/_pre/blog/hinako.kitano/img/2016/09/10/3446545/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ぐへへへへへへへ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hinako.kitano/img/files/46/_pre/blog/hinako.kitano/img/2016/09/10/3446545/0001.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まいったかー"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hinako.kitano/img/files/46/_pre/blog/hinako.kitano/img/2016/09/10/3446545/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"最近本を読んでいて\nいろいろ思うけど"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"どうしようもできない2人の関係の話しに\n泣いたあと不満を持つの。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"世の中にはどうにもできない\nどうしようもできないことで\n溢れているんだって気づくのが嫌だ！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"少し前まで\nどうしようもないしな～\n仕方ないしな～\nまあいいか～\nって良くも悪くも流すことができたけど\nそれができなくなって\n始まりから終わりまであって完結してる\n絶対に変えられない物語も\n変えたくなる！どうにかしたくなる！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"それも全部性格なんだろうな～\nこの性格が自分の気持ちが途切れない\n頑張れる一つのつっかえでもあるけど"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"この性格が頑固で不器用になってしまうつっかえでもあって。。。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"難しいな～"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"自分自身を見直すのに\n小説をたくさんよんで\n映画をたくさん観て\nたくさんいろんな考えや思いを\n吸収しなくちゃ！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hinako.kitano/img/files/46/_pre/blog/hinako.kitano/img/2016/09/10/3446545/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"それでは、今日はこのへんで！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"おやすみなさい！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"明日は朝からチップの散歩いくぞ～～"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"写真撮るね！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hinako.kitano/img/files/46/_pre/blog/hinako.kitano/img/2016/09/10/3446545/0002.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日の夕方の空"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"空と空が重なってるみたいだった！"}],"source":"archive"}